    "commit_message": "fix(quality): garak_gate.py fixes from live 2026-09-13 VM run (USS-TJR-MSN-0374 follow-up)\n\nLive run against the Model Router post-outage-fix surfaced real defects\nthe sandbox couldn't: \"hallucination\" was never a valid garak 0.17.0 probe\nfamily (every prior gate run silently failed with \"Unknown run.spec:\nprobes.hallucination\" and produced no report); the 120s request timeout\nwas shorter than the router's own 300s per-task budget; and garak's\ndefault generations/prompt-cap made a run against this serialized router\ntake over an hour. Fixes: correct probe name (packagehallucination),\n340s timeout, and gate-appropriate --generations/--prompt-cap defaults\nwith CLI overrides for a fuller periodic sweep.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01M5CxbeqXGEpbTcepT1Gh1W",
